47 17.6462 20.459 17.538C19.2559 17.15 17.2362 16.7016 17.2362 16.8226Z"
          ></path>
        </svg>
        <span>Visite meu site</span>
      </a>

      <a
        href={WA_LINK}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="links-card__link"
        data-tracking="whatsapp-link-arvore-de-links"
      >
        <svg viewBox="0 0 25 25" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="links-card__link-icon">
          <path
            d="M20.1611 4.74121C18.1152 2.69043 15.3906 1.5625 12.4951 1.5625C6.51855 1.5625 1.65527 6.42578 1.65527 12.4023C1.65527 14.3115 2.15332 16.1768 3.10059 17.8223L1.5625 23.4375L7.30957 21.9287C8.8916 22.793 10.6738 23.2471 12.4902 23.2471H12.4951C18.4668 23.2471 23.4375 18.3838 23.4375 12.4072C23.4375 9.51172 22.207 6.79199 20.1611 4.74121ZM12.4951 21.4209C10.874 21.4209 9.28711 20.9863 7.90527 20.166L7.57812 19.9707L4.16992 20.8643L5.07812 17.5391L4.86328 17.1973C3.95996 15.7617 3.48633 14.1064 3.48633 12.4023C3.48633 7.43652 7.5293 3.39355 12.5 3.39355C14.9072 3.39355 17.168 4.33105 18.8672 6.03516C20.5664 7.73926 21.6113 10 21.6064 12.4072C21.6064 17.3779 17.4609 21.4209 12.4951 21.4209ZM17.4365 14.6729C17.168 14.5361 15.835 13.8818 15.5859 13.7939C15.3369 13.7012 15.1563 13.6572 14.9756 13.9307C14.7949 14.2041 14.2773 14.8096 14.1162 14.9951C13.96 15.1758 13.7988 15.2002 13.5303 15.0635C11.9385 14.2676 10.8936 13.6426 9.84375 11.8408C9.56543 11.3623 10.1221 11.3965 10.6396 10.3613C10.7275 10.1807 10.6836 10.0244 10.6152 9.8877C10.5469 9.75098 10.0049 8.41797 9.78027 7.87598C9.60449 7.34863 9.42481 7.34863 9.29199 7.34277C9.16797 7.33301 9.02344 7.33301 8.87891 7.33301C8.69824 7.33301 8.40527 7.40137 8.15625 7.66992C7.90723 7.93848 7.20898 8.5918 7.20898 9.92578C7.20898 11.2598 8.18066 12.5488 8.3125 12.7295C8.44922 12.9102 10.2217 15.6445 12.9414 16.8213C14.6602 17.5635 15.334 17.627 16.1934 17.5C16.7158 17.4219 17.7949 16.8457 18.0195 16.2109C18.2441 15.5762 18.2441 15.0342 18.1758 14.9219C18.1123 14.7998 17.9316 14.7314 17.6631 14.5947L17.4365 14.6729Z"
